{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Me is a minimalist Arena Fighter and Battle Royale\u00a0</strong>that is very easy to learn, but difficult to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds of 1v1 Me begin with your opponent  on the opposite end of a large, dark arena. There are 5 maps, each emphasizing different playstyles. <strong>Kill your opponent to win a round. The first to win 3 rounds wins the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Games of 1v1 Me can be as short as 3 minutes to a max of 15, making it the perfect game when you're short on time</strong> or to quickly settle petty disputes with friends like &quot;Who's the better player?&quot; or &quot;Who's buying pizza tonight?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your creativity is your only limit in combat.</strong> Armed with a sword, a gun, and blinding speed,  combine your abilities to find success on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize mind games, conditioning, and create fear in your opponent to catch them off guard. <strong>Keeping a clear mind is critical to your survival.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2194740?t=1761896938","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194740/1558591fe97c05067d9a697f6c834afb79325957/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761896938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194740/b99de083b4e85d7618a88e5a4beda98a27a6598f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761896938","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194740/b99de083b4e85d7618a88e5a4beda98a27a6598f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761896938","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Me is a minimalist Arena Fighter and Battle Royale\u00a0</strong>that is very easy to learn, but difficult to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds of 1v1 Me begin with your opponent  on the opposite end of a large, dark arena. There are 5 maps, each emphasizing different playstyles. <strong>Kill your opponent to win a round. The first to win 3 rounds wins the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Games of 1v1 Me can be as short as 3 minutes to a max of 15, making it the perfect game when you're short on time</strong> or to quickly settle petty disputes with friends like &quot;Who's the better player?&quot; or &quot;Who's buying pizza tonight?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your creativity is your only limit in combat.</strong> Armed with a sword, a gun, and blinding speed,  combine your abilities to find success on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize mind games, conditioning, and create fear in your opponent to catch them off guard. <strong>Keeping a clear mind is critical to your survival.</strong></p>","developers":["A3 Industries","David Henry"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194740/ef6a2426977d2d5f7641bfa6ec3a5a5ee4efc6af/header.jpg?t=1761896938","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla